name pst-vehicle
category Package
revision 61438
shortdesc A PSTricks package for rolling vehicles on graphs of mathematical functions
longdesc This package permits to represent vehicles rolling without
longdesc slipping on mathematical curves. Different types of vehicles
longdesc are proposed, the shape of the curve is to be defined by its
longdesc equation "y=f(x)" in algebraic notation.
